    <briefdescription>
<para>Local helpers of the TAP reporter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The unnamed namespace gives the helpers internal linkage, so that they are visible only in this translation unit, and cannot conflict with the names of the application or of the other source files of the framework. They are not declared in any header.</para>
<para>It contains the functions that make the texts safe to write in the TAP output: <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1anonymous__namespace_02reporter-tap_8cpp_03_1aec79a35b7936b91bee63d9baf4f8c861" kindref="member">tap_text()</ref></computeroutput>, for the test point descriptions, the reasons, and the comments, and <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1anonymous__namespace_02reporter-tap_8cpp_03_1ae344ed13847263c08e39a3e9266c0109" kindref="member">yaml_double_quoted()</ref></computeroutput>, for the values of the YAML diagnostic blocks. </para>
